{"seq":2,"slug":"big-data-technology","title":"大数据技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"大数据技术-简介\">大数据技术 简介</h1><p>大数据技术专业（510205）是面向数字经济时代的核心技术方向，培养掌握数据采集、存储、计算、分析全链路能力的高素质技术技能人才。本专业对应的典型岗位包括大数据实施与运维工程师、数据采集与处理工程师、大数据分析与可视化工程师、大数据平台管理员等。</p>\n<p>当前产业界对大数据人才的需求持续旺盛。随着实时流处理、LLM 数据工程、DataOps 等新范式的兴起，企业不仅需要能操作 Hadoop/Spark 集群的运维人员，更需要具备数据治理意识、能设计端到端数据流水线的复合型工程师。本课程体系紧跟 2026 年行业前沿，将传统批处理与现代流计算、云原生部署深度融合。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>数据编程基础</strong>从 Python 数据编程、SQL 数据库、Linux Shell 三大基石出发，为后续大数据平台操作和数据分析奠定扎实的编程与系统基础。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>大数据平台技术</strong>深入讲解 Hadoop 生态、Spark 计算引擎和实时流处理三大核心平台技术，覆盖从离线批量到实时流式的完整计算范式。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>数据分析与可视化</strong>聚焦统计分析方法、可视化工具（Tableau/Power BI/ECharts）和机器学习基础，培养将海量数据转化为业务洞察的分析能力。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>数据工程实践</strong>面向生产环境，涵盖数据采集与 ETL 流水线、数据治理体系、云上大数据部署与 DataOps，帮助学生具备企业级数据工程的落地能力。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先掌握第一章的编程基础，再学习第二章的平台技术，然后通过第三章的分析方法提升数据价值挖掘能力，最后在第四章的工程实践中将所有技能整合为完整的生产级方案。建议结合真实数据集进行项目驱动式学习，每章配合企业案例加深理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-programming-basics","title":"数据编程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"python-data-programming","title":"Python 数据编程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/python-data-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sql-database-fundamentals","title":"SQL 与数据库基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/sql-database-fundamentals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"linux-shell-scripting","title":"Linux 与 Shell 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/linux-shell-scripting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"big-data-platforms","title":"大数据平台技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hadoop-ecosystem","title":"Hadoop 生态","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/hadoop-ecosystem"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spark-computing","title":"Spark 计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/spark-computing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"realtime-stream-processing","title":"实时流处理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/realtime-stream-processing"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-analysis-visualization","title":"数据分析与可视化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-analysis-visualization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-analysis","title":"统计分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-analysis-visualization/statistical-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-visualization-tools","title":"数据可视化工具","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-analysis-visualization/data-visualization-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"machine-learning-basics","title":"机器学习基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-analysis-visualization/machine-learning-basics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-engineering-practice","title":"数据工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-engineering-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-collection-etl","title":"数据采集与 ETL","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-engineering-practice/data-collection-etl"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-governance","title":"数据治理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-engineering-practice/data-governance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cloud-big-data-deployment","title":"云上大数据部署","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-engineering-practice/cloud-big-data-deployment"}]}]}